  "description": "The viewer surface for DocWright reports: an HTML + inline-SVG projection of a paginated report page model with a JSON region map, and the services a viewer needs over that model — hit-testing, action resolution, full-text search, and toggling or sorting with incremental re-pagination. Deterministic, escaped, and driven by the same page model that produces the PDF, so a preview and an export cannot disagree.",
